], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"Combined Statement of Receipts, Outlays, and Balances of the United States\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [306, 853, 1297, 959], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"Government. This statement presents budget results and the cash-related assets and liabilities of the Federal Government with supporting details. Single copy price: $67.00 (domestic), $93.80 (foreign).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [282, 1049, 1300, 1080], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"Financial Report of the United States Government. This annual report provides\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [306, 1087, 1288, 1162], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"information about Government financial operations on the accrual basis. Single copy price: $26.00 (domestic), $36.40 (foreign).\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [275, 1254, 842, 1285], \"page_id\": 2}], \"content\": \"\\u2020 Subscription order form on inside back cover.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [925, 382, 1118, 978], \"page_id\": 3}], \"content\": null, \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"figure\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [831, 1589, 1111, 1730], \"page_id\": 3}], \"content\": \"The Treasury Bulletin is for sale by the Superintendent of Documents U.S. Government Printing Office Washington, D.C. 20402.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [168, 776, 1463, 962], \"page_id\": 4}], \"content\": \"The Treasury Bulletin is issued quarterly in March, June, September, and December by the Financial Management Service, Governmentwide Accounting, Budget Reports Division. Statistical data is compiled from sources within Treasury departmental offices and bureaus, as well as various other Federal program agencies. Readers can contact the publication staff at (202) 874-9938/9939 to inquire about any of the published information. Suggestions are welcome.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [426, 997, 1211, 1037], \"page_id\": 4}], \"content\": \"The publication staff can also be reached by electronic mail.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [568, 1075, 1064, 1117], \"page_id\": 4}], \"content\": \"treasury.bulletin@fms.treas.gov\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [206, 1153, 1426, 1228], \"page_id\": 4}], \"content\": \"Internet service subscribers can access the Treasury Bulletin in Microsoft Word or PDF format through the Financial Management Service's home page.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [663, 1266, 967, 1306], \"page_id\": 4}], \"content\": \"www.fms.treas.gov/\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [681, 191, 934, 259], \"page_id\": 5}], \"content\": \"Contents\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 318, 545, 361], \"page_id\": 5}], \"content\": \"FINANCIAL OPERATIONS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [133, 380, 1474, 1751], \"page_id\": 5}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><td>PROFILE OF THE ECONOMY</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Analysis.\\u2014Summary of Economic Indicators</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>FEDERAL FISCAL OPERATIONS</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Introduction.\\u2014Federal Fiscal Operations</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><td>Analysis.\\u2014Budget Results and Financing of the U.S. Government and Second-Quarter Receipts by Source</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>FFO-A.\\u2014Chart: Monthly Receipts and Outlays</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>FFO-B.\\u2014Chart: Budget Receipts by Source</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>FFO-1.\\u2014Summary 