wn accounts. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of notes of Series AH-2013 is $100.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 18, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [831, 1629, 1140, 1659], \"page_id\": 40}], \"content\": \"Auction of 5-Year Notes\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 19, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [831, 1678, 1492, 1796], \"page_id\": 40}], \"content\": \"On February 17, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $35,000 million of 5-year notes. The issue was to refund $53,712 million of securities maturing February 28 and to raise new cash of approximately $54,288 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 20, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 1798, 1492, 1890], \"page_id\": 40}], \"content\": \"The 5-year notes of Series U-2016 were dated and issued February 28. They are due February 29, 2016, with interest payable on the last calendar day of August and February until\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 21, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1392, 1994, 1490, 2018], \"page_id\": 40}], \"content\": \"June 2011\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 22, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [135, 85, 184, 132], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"34\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [625, 90, 1005, 139], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"PUBLIC DEBT OPERATIONS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [362, 189, 1279, 240], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"TREASURY FINANCING: JANUARY-MARCH, con.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [133, 257, 807, 358], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"maturity. Treasury set an interest rate of 2-1/8 percent after determining which tenders were accepted on a yield auction basis.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [126, 358, 807, 754], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"Treasury received tenders for the notes before 12:00 noon e.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.t. for competitive tenders on February 23. Tenders totaled $94,233 million; Treasury accepted $35,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were allotted securities at the high yield of 2.190 percent with an equivalent price of $99.693745. Treasury accepted in full all competitive tenders at yields lower than 2.190 percent. Tenders at the high yield were allotted 31.65 percent. The median yield was 2.120 percent, and the low yield was 2.058 percent. Noncompetitive tenders totaled $96 million. Competitive tenders accepted from private investors totaled $34,904 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [133, 752, 809, 882], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"In addition to the $35,000 million of tenders accepted in the auction process, Treasury accepted $1,923 million from FRBs for their own accounts. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of notes of Series U-2016 is $100.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [131, 886, 459, 924], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"Auction of 7-Year Notes\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [133, 929, 811, 1068], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"On February 17, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $29,000 million of 7-year notes. The issue was to refund $53,712 million of securities maturing February 28 and to raise new cash of approximately $54,288 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [133, 1068, 811, 1247], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"The 7-year notes of Series H-2018 were dated and issued February 28. They are due February 28, 2018, with interest payable on the last calendar day of August and February until maturity. Treasury set an interest rate of 2-3/4 percent after determining which tenders were accepted on a yield auction basis.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [126, 1247, 809, 1648], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"Treasury received tenders for the notes before 12:00 noon e.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.t. for competitive tenders on February 24. Tenders totaled $82,818 million; Treasury accepted $29,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were allotted securities at the high yield of 2.854 percent with an equivalent price of $99.344326. Treasury accepted in full all competitive tenders at yields lower than 2.854 percent. Tenders at the high yield were allotted 75.76 percent. The median yield was 2.790 percent, and the low yield was 2.736 percent. Noncompetitive tenders totaled $21 million. Competitive tenders accepted from private investors totaled $28,979 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [131, 1648, 814, 1770], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"In addition to the $29,000 million of tenders accepted in the auction process, Treasury accepted $1,593 million from FRBs for their own accounts. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of notes of Series H-2018 is $100.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [131, 1775, 461, 1824], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"Auction of 30-Year TIPS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 11, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [124, 1827, 814, 1898], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"On February 10, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $9,000 million of 30-year TIPS. The issue was to\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 12, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [827, 259, 1499, 330], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"refund $53,712 million of securities maturing February 28 and to raise new cash of approximately $54,288 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 13, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [818, 325, 1495, 507], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"The 30-year TIPS of February 2041 were dated February 15 and issued February 28. They are due February 15, 2041, with interest payable on August 15 and February 15 until maturity. Treasury set an interest rate of 2-1/8 percent after determining which tenders were accepted on a yield auction basis.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 14, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [818, 507, 1499, 1058], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"Treasury received tenders for the TIPS before 12:00 noon e.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.t. for competitive tenders on February 17. Tenders totaled $22,888 million; Treasury accepted $9,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were allotted securities at the high yield of 2.190 percent with an equivalent adjusted price of $98.655406. Treasury accepted in full all competitive tenders at yields lower than 2.190 percent. Tenders at the high yield were allotted 98.60 percent. The median yield was 2.130 percent, and the low yield was 1.999 percent. Noncompetitive tenders totaled $58 million. Competitive tenders accepted from private investors totaled $8,942 million. Adjusted accrued interest of $0.76373 per $1,000 must be paid for the period from February 15 to February 28. Both the unadjusted price of $98.576545 and the unadjusted accrued interest of $0.76312 were adjusted by an index ratio of 1.00080, for the period from February 15 to February 28.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 15, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [816, 1058, 1503, 1190], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"In addition to the $9,000 million of tenders accepted in the auction process, Treasury accepted $494 million from FRBs for their own accounts. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of TIPS of February 2041 is $100.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 16, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [821, 1197, 1000, 1249], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"MARCH\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 17, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [818, 1263, 1138, 1304], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"Cash Management Bills\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 18, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [818, 1306, 1503, 1499], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"On February 28, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $25,000 million of 49-day bills. They were issued March 3 and matured April 21. The issue was to raise new cash. Treasury auctioned the bills on March 1. Tenders totaled $127,828 million; Treasury accepted $25,001 million. The high bank discount rate was 0.125 percent.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 19, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [816, 1494, 1508, 1688], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"On March 21, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $5,000 million of 56-day bills. They were issued March 24 and matured May 19. The issue was part of the SFP. Treasury auctioned the bills on March 23. Tenders totaled $33,933 million; Treasury accepted $5,000 million. The high bank discount rate was 0.055 percent.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 20, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [823, 1695, 1020, 1737], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"52-Week Bills\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 21, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [827, 1740, 1499, 1907], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"On March 3, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $23,000 million of 364-day Treasury bills. They were issued March 10, and will mature March 8, 2012. The issue was to refund $144,990 million of all maturing bills and pay down approximately $19,990 million. Treasury auctioned the bills\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 22, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [120, 1985, 264, 2020], \"page_id\": 41}], \"content\": \"June 2011\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 23, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [632, 99, 1002, 127], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"PUBLIC DEBT OPERATIONS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1454, 97, 1490, 127], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"35\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [375, 191, 1257, 231], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"TREASURY FINANCING: JANUARY-MARCH, con.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 262, 800, 387], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"on March 8. Tenders totaled $112,470 million; Treasury accepted $23,000 million, which included $220 million of noncompetitive tenders from the public. The high bank discount rate was 0.260 percent.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 401, 448, 429], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"Auction of 3-Year Notes\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 448, 798, 540], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"On March 3, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $32,000 million of 3-year notes. The issue was to raise new cash of approximately $66,000 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 540, 798, 695], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"The 3-year notes of Series X-2014 were dated and issued March 15. They are due March 15, 2014, with interest payable on September 15 and March 15 until maturity. Treasury set an interest rate of 1-1/4 percent after determining which tenders were accepted on a yield auction basis.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 695, 798, 1122], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"Treasury received tenders for the notes before 12:00 noon e.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.t. for competitive tenders on March 8. Tenders totaled $103,014 million; Treasury accepted $32,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were allotted securities at the high yield of 1.298 percent with the equivalent price of $99.859215. Treasury accepted in full all competitive tenders at yields lower than 1.298 percent. Tenders at the high yield were allotted 31.72 percent. The median yield was 1.267 percent, and the low yield was 1.197 percent. Noncompetitive tenders totaled $60 million. Competitive tenders accepted from private investors totaled $31,890 million. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of notes of Series X-2014 is $100.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1136, 747, 1164], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"Auction of 9-Year 11-Month 3-5/8 Percent Notes\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1186, 798, 1278], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"On March 3, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $21,000 million of 9-year 11-month 3-5/8 percent notes. The issue was to raise new cash of approximately $66,000 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1278, 798, 1400], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"The 9-year 11-month notes of Series B-2021 were dated February 15 and issued March 15. They are due February 15, 2021, with interest payable on August 15 and February 15 until maturity.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1400, 798, 1890], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"Treasury received tenders for the notes before 12:00 noon e.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.t. for competitive tenders on March 9. Tenders totaled $69,692 million; Treasury accepted $21,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were allotted securities at the high yield of 3.499 percent with an equivalent price of $101.044608. Treasury accepted in full all competitive tenders at yields lower than 3.499 percent. Tenders at the high yield were allotted 77.02 percent. The median yield was 3.475 percent, and the low yield was 3.410 percent. Noncompetitive tenders totaled $69 million. Competitive tenders accepted from private investors totaled $20,931 million. Accrued interest of $2.80387 per $1,000 must be paid for the period from February 15 to March 15. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of notes of Series B-2021 is $100.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 11, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 262, 1463, 292], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"Auction of 29-Year 11-Month 4-3/4 Percent Bonds\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 12, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 311, 1490, 434], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"On March 3, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $13,000 million of 29-year 11-month 4-3/4 percent bonds. The issue was to raise new cash of approximately $66,000 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 13, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 434, 1490, 554], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"The 29-year 11-month bonds of February 2041 were dated February 15 and issued March 15. They are due February 15, 2041, with interest payable on August 15 and February 15 until maturity.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 14, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 554, 1494, 1047], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"Treasury received tenders for the bonds before 12:00 noon e.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.t. for competitive tenders on March 10. Tenders totaled $39,263 million; Treasury accepted $13,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were allotted securities at the high yield of 4.569 percent with an equivalent price of $102.929408. Treasury accepted in full all competitive tenders at yields lower than 4.569 percent. Tenders at the high yield were allotted 45.51 percent. The median yield was 4.530 percent, and the low yield was 4.459 percent. Noncompetitive tenders totaled $19 million. Competitive tenders accepted from private investors totaled $12,981 million. Accrued interest of $3.67403 per $1,000 must be paid for the period from February 15 to March 15. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of bonds of February 2041 is $100.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 15, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 1061, 1138, 1091], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"Auction of 2-Year Notes\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 16, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 1108, 1490, 1228], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"On March 24, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $35,000 million of 2-year notes. The issue was to refund $54,462 million of securities maturing March 31 and to raise new cash of approximately $55,538 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 17, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 1233, 1492, 1384], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"The 2-year notes of Series AJ-2013 were dated and issued March 31. They are due March 31, 2013, with interest payable on September 30 and March 31 until maturity. Treasury set an interest rate of 0-3/4 percent after determining which tenders were accepted on a yield auction basis.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 18, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 1386, 1494, 1782], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"Treasury received tenders for the notes before 12:00 noon e.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.t. for competitive tenders on March 28. Tenders totaled $110,739 million; Treasury accepted $35,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were allotted securities at the high yield of 0.789 percent with an equivalent price of $99,922763. Treasury accepted in full all competitive tenders at yields lower than 0.789 percent. Tenders at the high yield were allotted 9.50 percent. The median yield was 0.750 percent, and the low yield was 0.686 percent. Noncompetitive tenders totaled $387 million. Competitive tenders accepted from private investors totaled $34,613 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 19, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [832, 1784, 1490, 1905], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"In addition to the $35,000 million of tenders accepted in the auction process, Treasury accepted $1,570 million from FRBs for their own accounts. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of notes of Series AJ-2013 is $100.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 20, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1392, 1985, 1492, 2015], \"page_id\": 42}], \"content\": \"June 2011\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 21, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 99, 173, 125], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"36\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [632, 99, 998, 125], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"PUBLIC DEBT OPERATIONS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [375, 191, 1257, 231], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"TREASURY FINANCING: JANUARY-MARCH, con.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 264, 446, 292], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"Auction of 5-Year Notes\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 311, 800, 434], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"On March 24, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $35,000 million of 5-year notes. The issue was to refund $54,462 million of securities maturing March 31 and to raise new cash of approximately $55,538 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 434, 798, 585], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"The 5-year notes of Series V-2016 were dated and issued March 31. They are due March 31, 2016, with interest payable on September 30 and March 31 until maturity. Treasury set an interest rate of 2-1/4 percent after determining which tenders were accepted on a yield auction basis.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 587, 798, 981], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"Treasury received tenders for the notes before 12:00 noon e.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.t. for competitive tenders on March 29. Tenders totaled $97,578 million; Treasury accepted $35,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were allotted securities at the high yield of 2.260 percent with an equivalent price of $99.952972. Treasury accepted in full all competitive tenders at yields lower than 2.260 percent. Tenders at the high yield were allotted 11.14 percent. The median yield was 2.201 percent, and the low yield was 2.123 percent. Noncompetitive tenders totaled $121 million. Competitive tenders accepted from private investors totaled $34,879 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 983, 798, 1106], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"In addition to the $35,000 million of tenders accepted in the auction process, Treasury accepted $1,570 million from FRBs for their own accounts. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of notes of Series V-2016 is $100.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1122, 448, 1150], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"Auction of 7-Year Notes\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1172, 798, 1292], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"On March 24, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $29,000 million of 7-year notes. The issue was to refund $54,462 million of securities maturing March 31 and to raise new cash of approximately $55,538 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1294, 798, 1445], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"The 7-year notes of Series J-2018 were dated and issued March 31. They are due March 31, 2018, with interest payable on September 30 and March 31 until maturity. Treasury set an interest rate of 2-7/8 percent after determining which tenders were accepted on a yield auction basis.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1447, 798, 1629], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"Treasury received tenders for the notes before 12:00 noon e.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.t. for competitive tenders on March 30. Tenders totaled $80,951 million; Treasury accepted $29,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were allotted securities at the high yield of 2.895 percent with an\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 11, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 264, 1488, 476], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"equivalent price of $99.874094. Treasury accepted in full all competitive tenders at yields lower than 2.895 percent. Tenders at the high yield were allotted 93.86 percent. The median yield was 2.825 percent, and the low yield was 2.769 percent. Noncompetitive tenders totaled $35 million. Competitive tenders accepted from private investors totaled $28,965 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 12, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 478, 1488, 601], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"In addition to the $29,000 million of tenders accepted in the auction process, Treasury accepted $1,301 million from FRBs for their own accounts. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of notes of Series J-2018 is $100.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 13, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 618, 1423, 646], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"Auction of 9-Year 10-Month 1-1/8 Percent TIPS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 14, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 665, 1488, 816], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"On March 17, 2011, Treasury announced it would auction $11,000 million of 9-year 10-month 1-1/8 percent TIPS. The issue was to refund $54,462 million of securities maturing March 31 and to raise new cash of approximately $55,538 million.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 15, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 818, 1488, 938], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"The 9-year 10-month TIPS of Series A-2021 were dated January 15 and issued March 31. They are due January 15, 2021, with interest payable on July 15 and January 15 until maturity.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 16, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 940, 1490, 1490], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"Treasury received tenders for the TIPS before 12:00 noon e.t. for noncompetitive tenders and before 1:00 p.m. e.t. for competitive tenders on March 24. Tenders totaled $32,688 million; Treasury accepted $11,000 million. All noncompetitive and successful competitive bidders were allotted securities at the high yield of 0.920 percent with an equivalent adjusted price of $102.584550. Treasury accepted in full all competitive tenders at yields lower than 0.920. Tenders at the high yield were allotted 77.76 percent. The median yield was 0.870 percent, and the low yield was 0.490 percent. Noncompetitive tenders totaled $68 million. Competitive tenders accepted from private investors totaled $10,932 million. Adjusted accrued interest of $2.34611 per $1,000 must be paid for the period from January 15 to March 31. Both the unadjusted price of $101.914969 and the unadjusted accrued interest of $2.33080 were adjusted by an index ratio of 1.00657, for the period from January 15 to March 31.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 17, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 1492, 1488, 1612], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"In addition to the $11,000 million of tenders accepted in the auction process, Treasury accepted $493 million from FRBs for their own accounts. The minimum par amount required for STRIPS of TIPS of Series A-2021 is $100.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 18, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1992, 242, 2018], \"page_id\": 43}], \"content\": \"June 2011\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 19, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [610, 101, 973, 123], \"page_id\": 44}], \"content\": \"PUBLIC DEBT OPERATIONS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1461, 99, 1490, 125], \"page_id\": 44}], \"content\": \"37\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [399, 207, 1246, 240], \"page_id\": 44}], \"content\": \"TABLE PDO-1.\\u2014Offerings of Regular Weekly Treasury Bills\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [552, 257, 1093, 276], \"page_id\": 44}], \"content\": \"[In millions of dollars. Source: Bureau of the Public Debt, Office of Financing]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [157, 280, 1484, 1683], \"page_id\": 44}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th>Issue date</th><th>Description of new issue</th><th>Number of days to maturity<sup>1</sup></th><th>Amount of bids tendered</th><th>Amounts of bids accepted</th><th>On total competitive bids accepted</th></tr><tr><th></th><th>Maturity date (1)</th><th>(2)</th><th>(3)</th><th>Total amount<sup>2</sup> (4)</th><th>On competitive basis (5)</th><th>On non-competitive basis (6)</th><th>High price per hundred (7)</th><th>High discount rate (percent) (8)</th><th>High investment rate (percent)<sup>4</sup> (9)</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"10\\\">Regular weekly: (4 week, 13 week, and 26 week)</td></tr><tr><td>2011 - Jan. 06</td><td>2011 - Feb. 03</td><td>28</td><td>120,606.8</td><td>27,418.4</td><td>24,745.9</td><td>254.5</td><td>99.990667</td><td>0.120</td><td>0.122</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>Apr. 07</td><td>91</td><td>134,264.9</td><td>29,000.1</td><td>27,750.0</td><td>1,050.2</td><td>99.962083</td><td>0.150</td><td>