following dates.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [874, 1763, 1556, 1893], \"page_id\": 53}], \"content\": \"Note.\\u2014Table is based on Treasury data and on data reported to the Treasury by banks, other depositary institutions and brokers in the United States. Data generally correspond to statistics following in this section and in the \\u201cCapital Movements\\u201d section. Table excludes International Monetary Fund \\u201choldings of dollars\\u201d and holdings of U.S. Treasury letters of credit and nonnegotiable noninterest-bearing special U.S. notes held by international and regional organizations.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [137, 1987, 251, 2011], \"page_id\": 53}], \"content\": \"June 2011\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [550, 101, 1086, 127], \"page_id\": 54}], \"content\": \"INTERNATIONAL FINANCIAL STATISTICS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1455, 97, 1494, 127], \"page_id\": 54}], \"content\": \"49\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [324, 196, 1311, 269], \"page_id\": 54}], \"content\": \"TABLE IFS-3.\\u2014Nonmarketable U.S. Treasury Bonds and Notes Issued to Official Institutions and Other Residents of Foreign Countries\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [536, 280, 1102, 304], \"page_id\": 54}], \"content\": \"[In millions of dollars. Source: Treasury International Capital Reporting System]\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [144, 311, 1494, 1725], \"page_id\": 54}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th>End of calendar year or month</th><th>Grand total (1)</th><th colspan=\\\"3\\\">Payable in dollars</th></tr><tr><th></th><th></th><th>Total (2)</th><th>Argentina 1 (3)</th><th>Venez