mestic Securities by Type and Country</td><td>74</td></tr><tr><td>CM-IV-4.\\u2014U.S. Transactions with Foreigners in Long-Term Domestic and Foreign Securities, by Type and Country, during (first quarter)</td><td>76</td></tr><tr><td>CM-IV-5.\\u2014U.S. Transactions with Foreigners in Long-Term Domestic and Foreign Securities, by Type and Country, during (calendar year)</td><td>78</td></tr><tr><td>CM-C.\\u2014Chart: Net Purchases of Long-Term Domestic Securities by Foreigners, Selected Countries</td><td>80</td></tr><tr><td>CM-D.\\u2014Chart: Net Purchases of Long-Term Foreign Securities by U.S. Investors</td><td>81</td></tr><tr><td>SECTION V.\\u2014Holdings of, and Transactions in, Derivatives Contracts with Foreigners Reported by Businesses in the United States</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>CM-V-1.\\u2014Gross Totals of Holdings with Positive and Negative Fair Values by Type of Contract</td><td>82</td></tr><tr><td>CM-V-2.\\u2014Gross Total of Holdings with Negative Fair Values, by Country</td><td>83</td></tr><tr><td>CM-V-3.\\u2014Gross Total of Holdings with Positive Fair Values, by Country</td><td>84</td></tr><tr><td>CM-V-4.\\u2014Net Cash Settlements Received by U.S. Residents from Foreign Residents, by Type of Contract</td><td>85</td></tr><tr><td>CM-V-5.\\u2014Net Cash Settlements Received by U.S. Residents from Foreign Residents, by Country</td><td>86</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [142, 1987, 248, 2020], \"page_id\": 6}], \"content\": \"June 2012\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1470, 94, 1488, 130], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"V\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [681, 203, 936, 255], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"Contents\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [144, 290, 579, 318], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"FOREIGN CUR