<td>ORDER FORM FOR TREASURY PUBLICATIONS</td><td>Inside back cover</td></tr></table>\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"table\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 1080, 1479, 1141], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"NOTES: Definitions for words shown in italics can be found in the glossary; Figures may not add to totals because of rounding; p = Preliminary; n.a. = Not available; r = Revised.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 1987, 248, 2022], \"page_id\": 7}], \"content\": \"June 2013\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"page_footer\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1455, 97, 1490, 132], \"page_id\": 8}], \"content\": \"VII\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [131, 189, 1492, 1593], \"page_id\": 8}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th colspan=\\\"4\\\">Nonquarterly Tables and Reports</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"4\\\">For the convenience of the \\\"Treasury Bulletin\\\" user, nonquarterly tables and reports are listed below along with the issues in which they appear.</td></tr><tr><th></th><th>March</th><th>June</th><th>Sept.</th><th>Dec.</th></tr><tr><th colspan=\\\"5\\\">Federal Fiscal Operations</th></tr><tr><td>FFO-5.\\u2014Internal Revenue Receipts by State</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>\\u221a</td></tr><tr><td>FFO-6.\\u2014Customs and Border Protection Collection of Duties, Taxes and Fees by Districts and Ports</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>\\u221a</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\\\"5\\\">Special Reports</th></tr><tr><td>Financial Report of the United States Government excerpt</td><td>\\u221a</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\\\"5\\\">Trust Fund Reports:</th></tr><tr><td>Agriculture Disaster Relief Trust Fund</td><td></td><td>\\u221a</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Airport and Airway Trust Fund</td><td></td><td>\\u221a</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Black Lung Disability Trust Fund</td><td></td><td>\\u221a</td><td>