": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 278, 1488, 549], \"page_id\": 104}], \"content\": \"Table ESF-1 presents the assets, liabilities, and capital of the fund. The figures are in U.S. dollars or their equivalents based on current exchange rates computed according to the accrual method of accounting. The capital account represents the original capital appropriated to the fund by Congress of $2 billion, minus a subsequent transfer of $1.8 billion to pay for the initial U.S. quota subscription to the International Monetary Fund. Gains and losses are reflected in the cumulative net income (+) or loss (-) account.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [834, 561, 1488, 771], \"page_id\": 104}], \"content\": \"Table ESF-2 shows the results of operations by quarter. Figures are in U.S. dollars or their equivalents computed according to the accrual method. \\\"Profit (+) or loss (-) on foreign exchange\\\" includes realized profits or losses. \\\"Adjustment for change in valuation of SDR holdings and allocations\\\" reflects net gain or loss on revaluation of SDR holdings and allocations for the quarter.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [295, 837, 1339, 872], \"page_id\": 104}], \"content\": \"TABLE ESF-1.\\u2014Balances as of September 30, 2012, and December 31, 2012\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [464, 886, 1166, 908], \"page_id\": 104}], \"content\": \"(In thousands of dollars. Source: Office of the Assistant Secretary of the Treasury for Management)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"caption\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [140, 910, 1490, 1853], \"page_id\": 104}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th>Assets, liabilities, and capital</th><th>Sept. 30, 2012</th><th>Oct. 1, 2012, through Dec. 31, 2012</th><th>Dec. 31, 2012</th></tr><tr><td><b>Assets</b></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>U.S. dollars:</td><td